-- by reading the state names. The legal card's fade task (0x021D32A4) blends BOTH 0x04000050 and
-- 0x04001050 — engine A and engine B — so the copyright panel and the online notice come up
-- TOGETHER, which is why one interrupts and the other queues behind it. The developer card's two
-- fades are byte-identical to each other except for that literal: state 3's task (0x021D3360) writes
-- 0x04000050 only and state 4's (0x021D33A8) writes 0x04001050 only. The emblem is loaded to a MAIN
-- layer and the wording to a SUB layer (ov77_021D2F38 passes layer 2 for member 17 and layer 6 for
