	-- MysteryGift_CheckIsWcSlotOccupied 0x0202DD6A-0x0202DD76 (cards at +0x920, stride 0xD6*4,
	-- type u16 at +0), MysteryGift_CheckWcHasPgtSaved 0x0202DDA8-0x0202DDDC (PGTs at +0x100, stride
	-- 0x104, slot = low two bits of the u16 at +2), CheckIsValidWcType: 0 < type < 14.
