-- String_Free the instant Text_IsPrinterActive goes false (0x021D15F6-0x021D15F8), and only THEN
-- waits for A in state 2. So the text is readable during state 1 and is dangling memory afterwards
-- — the Gen V use-after-free bug class, sitting right here in the first screen of the game. Gating
-- on state 1 is what keeps us on the live side of it, and String_Free poisoning the integrity word
-- before it frees is the second net underneath.
