			-- state, and only while the block is actually on screen: displayTextBlockState 1..4 is
			-- everything between "drawn" and "faded out", which is exactly when the player is
			-- reading it. Said once per visit — the state itself is the identity, so revisiting the
			-- controls from the menu reads them again.
