			-- ⛔ IT IS NOT A CHOICE BOX, which is why the choice reader at the bottom of this module
			-- never saw it and this screen was silent. There is no widget at all: RowanIntro_Run's
			-- GENDR_CHOICE case reads the pad itself, and LEFT or RIGHT simply FLIPS playerGender
			-- between GENDER_MALE and GENDER_FEMALE while A accepts it. The whole state of the screen
			-- is that one int, so that one int is what we read.
